    "%@. Check Bluetooth and this app’s Bluetooth permission in System Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@. Check Bluetooth and this app’s Bluetooth permission in System Settings."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@。请检查系统蓝牙与应用的蓝牙权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1. Pair the remote in Bluetooth settings.\n2. Install BlackHole 2ch and select it above.\n3. Select the same microphone in WeChat Input’s voice settings and keep the left Ctrl shortcut.\n4. Focus a text field, hold the remote’s voice button to speak, and release it to finish.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1. Pair the remote in Bluetooth settings.\n2. Install BlackHole 2ch and select it above.\n3. Select the same microphone in WeChat Input’s voice settings and keep the left Ctrl shortcut.\n4. Focus a text field, hold the remote’s voice button to speak, and release it to finish."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1. 在系统蓝牙中配对遥控器。\n2. 安装并在上方选择 BlackHole 2ch。\n3. 在微信输入法的语音设置中选择同一麦克风，保留左 Ctrl 快捷键。\n4. 把光标放进文本框，按住遥控器语音键说话，松开结束。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
